  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6655904",
      "title": "Using ngIf to Output Data Conditionally",
      "lectureOrder": 358,
      "videoOrder": 333,
      "sourceHash": "32162ce3ca6aef9939abae409ca4020d10c39e6cb0925bb7768ecd3838c5702c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.91,
          "end": 5.773,
          "en": "-: In the example application we built thus far",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.773,
          "end": 7.5,
          "en": "we haven't used any directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.5,
          "end": 10.74,
          "en": "besides components which are directives, that's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.74,
          "end": 12.78,
          "en": "But we haven't used any other directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.78,
          "end": 14.519,
          "en": "no built in directives.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.519,
          "end": 18.33,
          "en": "Now let's say one thing we want to do is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.33,
          "end": 23.31,
          "en": "we only want to show this server was created text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.31,
          "end": 25.26,
          "en": "There is no need to have this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.26,
          "end": 28.74,
          "en": "No server was created text to be displayed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.74,
          "end": 29.573,
          "en": "So what would be nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.573,
          "end": 32.94,
          "en": "if we could conditionally show this message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.94,
          "end": 35.58,
          "en": "And for that we need some help.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.58,
          "end": 38.2,
          "en": "We can use a directive shipping with Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.2,
          "end": 41.22,
          "en": "the NG if directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.22,
          "end": 44.34,
          "en": "Now it works like a if statement and to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.34,
          "end": 48.9,
          "en": "it works like this, in our service component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.9,
          "end": 51.12,
          "en": "where we output these server creation status.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.12,
          "end": 52.95,
          "en": "I will comment this out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.95,
          "end": 55.62,
          "en": "so that we can still reference this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.62,
          "end": 58.47,
          "en": "but now I will add a new paragraph where I simply say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.47,
          "end": 60.829,
          "en": "server was created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.829,
          "end": 64.728,
          "en": "Server name is bind my server name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.728,
          "end": 67.357,
          "en": "Now with this in place, it will still work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.357,
          "end": 70.2,
          "en": "but now we always see with every keystroke",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.2,
          "end": 73.74,
          "en": "how we change this server name, not really what I want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.74,
          "end": 75.51,
          "en": "Instead, I want to output it as soon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.51,
          "end": 77.554,
          "en": "as we click this button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.554,
          "end": 81.757,
          "en": "So what I can do is I can add a directive here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.757,
          "end": 84.423,
          "en": "And as I said, typically directives are added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.423,
          "end": 86.85,
          "en": "by using a attribute selector.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.85,
          "end": 88.71000000000001,
          "en": "And pretty much all the built-in directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 88.71000000000001,
          "end": 91.77,
          "en": "use that selector NG if does.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.77,
          "end": 95.64,
          "en": "And then NG if is added by adding a star.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.64,
          "end": 98.50999999999999,
          "en": "This is important NG if,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.50999999999999,
          "end": 103.32,
          "en": "the star is required because NG if is a structural directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.32,
          "end": 106.68,
          "en": "which means it changes the structure of our dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.68,
          "end": 110.18299999999999,
          "en": "It either adds this element or it doesn't add it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.18299999999999,
          "end": 113.7,
          "en": "So that's just some extra information for Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.7,
          "end": 116.7,
          "en": "The directive itself is just NG if,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.7,
          "end": 118.47,
          "en": "but the star is required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.47,
          "end": 120.954,
          "en": "Without it, it will not work correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 120.954,
          "end": 125.954,
          "en": "So NG if, and then we can set up our condition here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.78,
          "end": 128.34,
          "en": "between quotation marks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.34,
          "end": 131.61,
          "en": "For NG if, this has to be any expression,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.61,
          "end": 134.34,
          "en": "returning true or false, deciding whether",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 134.34,
          "end": 136.62,
          "en": "this should be added or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 136.62,
          "end": 139.943,
          "en": "So here it would make sense to add a new property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.943,
          "end": 144.167,
          "en": "which we name server created and set it to false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.167,
          "end": 146.82,
          "en": "And we set this to true once the button is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 146.82,
          "end": 149.28,
          "en": "So here in on create server, which is triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.28,
          "end": 150.84,
          "en": "when the button is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150.84,
          "end": 155.73,
          "en": "Here we set server created equal to true like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 155.73,
          "end": 158.67000000000002,
          "en": "Now with this we can go back to our template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.67000000000002,
          "end": 162.46800000000002,
          "en": "and simply bind NG if to server created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 162.46800000000002,
          "end": 165.15,
          "en": "And again, this could also call a method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 165.15,
          "end": 166.86,
          "en": "which returns true or false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 166.86,
          "end": 170.25,
          "en": "or directly perform the check between quotation marks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.25,
          "end": 172.497,
          "en": "anything which returns true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.497,
          "end": 174.696,
          "en": "Now with this, if we save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.696,
          "end": 177.362,
          "en": "what you see is that there is no text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 177.362,
          "end": 181.455,
          "en": "But if I name this test server two and click the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 181.455,
          "end": 184.167,
          "en": "Now the text is added here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 184.167,
          "end": 186.38400000000001,
          "en": "And the interesting thing is if I reload the app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 186.38400000000001,
          "end": 190.034,
          "en": "and we inspect our dom here, you see here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 190.034,
          "end": 194.4,
          "en": "that's our app server component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 194.4,
          "end": 196.903,
          "en": "Below that is above that is the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 196.903,
          "end": 199.014,
          "en": "But if I clicked this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 199.014,
          "end": 202.322,
          "en": "a new element was entered here, the paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 202.322,
          "end": 205.41,
          "en": "And here you see kind of the hook",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 205.41,
          "end": 208.86,
          "en": "which Angular created to know where this should be entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 208.86,
          "end": 211.474,
          "en": "But the important thing is it's really added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 211.474,
          "end": 214.53,
          "en": "or removed to or from the dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 214.53,
          "end": 216,
          "en": "It's not there all the time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 216,
          "end": 218.46,
          "en": "It's not hidden, it's just not there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 218.46,
          "end": 221.04,
          "en": "which is super important to understand.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 221.04,
          "end": 222.69,
          "en": "So that's NG if.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 222.69,
          "end": 225.48,
          "en": "Again, the start at the beginning indicates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 225.48,
          "end": 227.41,
          "en": "that this is a structural directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 228.411,
          "end": 231.003,
          "en": "really changing the dome as you just saw.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
